### 鉴权API测试

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@phoneNumber = 12345678901
@username = first_user
@password = testpassword

### 注册新用户
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone_number": "{{phoneNumber}}",
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone_number": "{{phoneNumber}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

# 登录并复制响应中的token来更新@token变量，可用于其他需要登录的API测试
